1. Landing Page
a. As a user, I want to see product info, so I understand what the app offers.
b. As a user, I want to access login/signup, so I can start using the app.
2. User Authentication Page
a. As a new user, I want to register, so I can create an account.
b. As a returning user, I want to log in, so I can access my account.
c. As a user, I want to reset my password, so I don’t lose access.
3. Workspace Collaboration Dashboard
a. As a user, I want to view my workspaces, so I can switch between them.
b. As a user, I want to create a workspace, so I can organize projects.
4. Rich Notes Page
a. As a user, I want to create/edit tasks, so I can track work.
b. As a user, I want to set due dates, so I don’t miss deadlines.
c. As a user, I want to update task status, so I can track progress.
d. As a user, I want to add comments, so I can share details with my team.
5. Email Reminders
a. As a user, I want to get reminders before tasks are due, so I can prepare.
b. As a user, I want to get reminders after missed deadlines, so I don’t forget work.

